*.pyc

# The asset generators need trimesh + numpy, which this distro's python will
# not install system-wide (PEP 668). `python3 -m venv tools/.venv` and
# `tools/.venv/bin/pip install trimesh numpy` gets them; the venv itself is
# not something to commit.
tools/.venv/
